 services. Here\'s what you can do next:\r\n\r\nGo to Dashboard: https://dashboard.api.co.id\r\n\r\n## Quick Links\r\n\r\n**Get Your API Credentials**\r\nGenerate your API key to start using our services immediately.\r\n\r\n🔑 Get API Credentials: https://dashboard.api.co.id/profile/credentials\r\n\r\n**Browse Our Products**\r\nExplore our available APIs and documentation to find what you need.\r\n\r\n📦 Browse Products: https://dashboard.api.co.id/products\r\n\r\n## What You Can Do\r\n\r\n✨ **Access Free APIs** - Get instant access to real-time exchange rates, holiday data, and more\r\n🚀 **Unlimited Requests** - All APIs are free to use with unlimited requests\r\n📊 **Monitor Usage** - Track your API calls and usage statistics\r\n🛠️ **Developer Friendly** - Clean, well-documented APIs ready for integration\r\n\r\n## Need Help?\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to our support team through your dashboard or reply to this email. We\'re here to help you succeed!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Account Details:**\r\n- **Email:** office@mybbs.id\r\n- **Account Created:** September 14, 2026\r\n\r\nThanks again for joining us. We\'re excited to see what you build!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n**The Api.co.id Team**\r\n\r\n© 2026 Api.co.id. All rights reserved.','<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head>\r\n<title>Api.co.id</title>\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\r\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\r\n<style>\r\n@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {\r\n.inner-body {\r\nwidth: 100% !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.footer {\r\nwidth: 100% !important;\r\n}\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media only screen and (max-width: 500px) {\r\n.button {\