latform \r\n\r\n\r\n You now have access to start building with Claude. Start with these three \r\nsteps:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n 1. Add credits \r\n\r\n\r\nAdd credits \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/settings/billing?utm_content=inline_link> before \r\nyour first call. $5 is enough to build and test a first integration.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n 2. Get your API key \r\n\r\n\r\n Create a key in the Claude Console \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys?utm_content=inline_link> and set it \r\nas an environment variable.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nexport ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=\"your-api-key-here\" \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n 3. Make your first call \r\n\r\n\r\n Pick your client (including cURL, CLI, Python, TypeScript, Java, and more) \r\nand copy a ready-to-run example from thequickstart \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/get-started?utm_content=inline_link>. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPython \r\nimport anthropic\r\n\r\nclient = anthropic.Anthropic()\r\n\r\nmessage = client.messages.create(\r\n model=\"claude-opus-5-5\",\r\n max_tokens=1000,\r\n messages=[\r\n {\r\n \"role\": \"user\",\r\n \"content\": \"Hello, Claude!\",\r\n }\r\n ],\r\n) \r\n\r\n\r\nAdd credits <https://platform.claude.com/settings/billing?utm_content=hero_cta>\r\n\r\n\r\n Explore what’s possible \r\n\r\n\r\n Need help getting started? Review our step-by-step guide \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/get-started?utm_content=inline_link> to \r\nmaking your first API call.\r\n\r\n\r\n A few other places to start: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCookbooks <https://platform.claude.com/cookbook?utm_content=inline_link> \r\n\r\n\r\n Build on the Claude Platform using ready-to-copy code snippets that you can \r\nintegrate into your own projects.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQuickstarts \r\n<https://github.com/anthropics/claude-quickstarts?utm_content=inline_link> \r\n\r\n\r\n Explore projects that you can easily build upon and customize for your \r\nspecific needs.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAPI reference \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/overview?utm_content=inline_link> \r\n\r\n\r\n Learn about available endpoints, client SDKs, and more. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPrompting best practices \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/claude-prompting-best-practices?utm_content=inline_link>\r\n\r\n\r\n Read a comprehensive guide on prompt engineering techniques for the latest \r\nClaude models.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nClaude Managed Agents (beta)  \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/workspaces/default/agent-quickstart?utm_content=inline_link>\r\n\r\n\r\n Deploy cloud-hosted agents, from single-task runners to complex multiagent \r\npipelines.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExplore developer docs \r\n<https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/home?utm_content=secondary_cta> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Was this email useful? \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://form.typeform.com/to/Tvcv65tC?utm_content=feedback_up&#footerSurveyUp> \r\n \r\n<https://form.typeform.com/to/Tvcv65tC?utm_content=feedback_down&#footerSurveyDown>\r\n\r\n <https://claude.ai/?#footerLogo> \r\n\r\n <https://apps.apple.com/us/app/claude-by-anthropic/id6473753684?#footeriOS>  \r\n<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.anthropic.claude&#footerAndroid>\r\n\r\n <https://www.instagram.com/claudeai/?hl=en&#footerInstagram>  \r\n<https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/claude/?#footerLinkedIn>  \r\n<https://x.com/claudeai?#footerX>  \r\n<https://www.youtube.com/@anthropic-ai?#footerYoutube> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Anthropic PBC, 54‌8 M‌a‌r‌k‌e‌t S‌t, PMB 9‌0‌3‌7‌5, Sa‌n F‌r‌a‌n‌c‌i‌s‌c‌o, \r\nC‌A 9‌4‌1‌0‌4 \r\n\r\n\r\n This email was sent to office@mybbs.id. To opt out of future emails, click \r\nunsubscribe \r\n<https://links.email.claude.com/s/u/4ZvDDaTaAlSDVtFSg4SSMy-AB1ScA5CYKbTVMHUt0-vB3VMYd1hHUdQRaQ2dFb_a3zoE87kp7XvIiPoQhzjN0QqGmiRSVpuoOvRaNw6vOjMPH7KdlvNQ9h96zLnbzDDt8hqxtErpSdAxjHagU_iaPn2r40Dy6QD39P1TVBjDzBcqOSPUXhtzDhBC0QbnyWA5K7nv27iKTLppd5i-/oxp8bFdi33Wg9TbUrvjkOPM-3yy1qgMS/25#footerUnsub>\r\n.','<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DT