Vw2Vgy9Yg\r\n\r\nVisit the Apple Developer Forums this week to ask technical questions and follow conversations about working with Photos & Camera APIs, SwiftUI, and UIKit.\r\n\r\nSign up for Q&As\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92jALGB7I39qo58Lw2sn%2Bl48VYgma3hds%2BYvCeFtwFs%2F0oW2lsboYLWy%2B9lZhbImnxhqIEKsuhPRifED9itiXvr57B3K2ZhEJn9r7TTUofAQ0UPbTuEpJb6OThbTxPMcX5Af5pwMQ8T1SBRR45anKE%2BKKXptR3uj7yV6Qc8bBo9KF4PBD05xNQdOqU85ktZGVTx1V%2BIukZ9OaAAPQHdCYntrGEIDMwh9chfhhVGqtMDZ2HjWU8jaKL86aZ3IeXf9d%2FQhua93sj1FEBIZLUoWcoe%2B\r\n\r\nAnd watch iPhone Duo Group Labs on demand to get insights directly from Apple engineers and designers.\r\n\r\nWatch now\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92jALGB7I39qo58Lw2sn%2Bl48VYgma3hds%2BYvCeFtwFs%2F0oW2lsboYLWy%2B9lZhbImnxhqIEKsuhPRifED9itiXvr57B3K2ZhEJn9r7TTUofAQ0UPbTuEpJb6OThbTxPMcX5Af5pwMQ8T1SBRR45anKE%2BKKXptR3uj7yV6Qc8bBo9KF4PBD05xNQdOqU85ktZGVTx1V%2BIukZ9OaAAPQHdCYntrGEIDMwh9chfhhVGqtMDZ2CUq%2BYBUKM131Belzu%2FMbeI70JHj15mI7VUXU7YtogWY\r\n\r\nA smiling presenter with shoulder-length hair stands on a stage, gesturing with both hands raised during a presentation. He wears a dark gray t-shirt, blue jeans, and dark sneakers, standing in front of a large white screen. The screen displays the text \"Quality products have performance,\" with the presenter\'s body partially obscuring the beginning of the word \"performance.\"\r\n\r\nFeatured\r\n\r\nBoost your app’s speed and efficiency\r\n\r\nOn October 29, learn how to maximize your app’s performance and efficiency with Apple tools and technologies. In this all-day event, you’ll discover how to identify performance opportunities, use Xcode and Instruments to gather and analyze diagnostics, and turn your data into action.\r\n\r\nRequest to join us in Cupertino\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92jALGB7I39qo58Lw2sn%2Bl48VYgma3hds%2BYvCeFtwFs%2F0oW2lsboYLWy%2B9lZhbImnxhqIEKsuhPRifED9itiXvr57B3K2ZhEJn9r7TTUofAQ0UPbTuEpJb6OThbTxPMcX5Af5pwMQ8T1SBRR45anKE%2BKKXptR3uj7yV6Qc8bBo9KF4PBD05xNQdOqU85ktZGVTx1V%2BIukZ9OaAAPQHdCYntrGEIDMwh9chfhhVGqtMDZ2E9Ph%2BOupgcybwqUqh2zOckQb9PmfP6rvgyC41owSXH1\r\n\r\nSign up for the livestream\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92jALGB7I39qo58Lw2sn%2Bl48VYgma3hds%2BYvCeFtwFs%2F0oW2lsboYLWy%2B9lZhbImnxhqIEKsuhPRifED9itiXvr57B3K2ZhEJn9r7TTUofAQ0UPbTuEpJb6OThbTxPMcX5Af5pwMQ8T1SBRR45anKE%2BKKXptR3uj7yV6Qc8bBo9KF4PBD05xNQdOqU85ktZGVTx1V%2BIukZ9OaAAPQHdCYntrGEIDMwh9chfhhVGqtMDZ2LwQFsYNhI4%2B%2FaSBcFhQrVe3Wcy3XXnYRr5CsYG%2FXI1U\r\n\r\nComing soon\r\n\r\nSeptember — October\r\n\r\nAppointment\r\n\r\nApp Review appointment\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92jALGB7I39qo58Lw2sn%2Bl48VYgma3hds%2BYvCeFtwFs%2F0oW2lsboYLWy%2B9lZhbImnxhqIEKsuhPRifED9itiXvr57B3K2ZhEJn9r7TTUofAQ0UPbTuEpJb6OThbTxPMcX5Af5pwMQ8T1SBRR45anKE%2BKKXptR3uj7yV6Qc8bBo9KF4PBD05xNQdOqU85ktZGVTx1V%2BIukZ9OaAAPQHdCYntrGEIDMwh9chfhhVGqtMDZ2KH05CCHiK3b%2Fhx%2FIUDs4UWvCrHNvANY2yGgd9IWt2mC\r\n\r\nOnline\r\n\r\nMultiple\r\n\r\nOctober 7\r\n\r\nSession\r\n\r\nIETF HLS Interest Day\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92jALGB7I39qo58Lw2sn%2Bl48VYgma3hds%2BYvCeFtwFs%2F0oW2lsboYLWy%2B9lZhbImnxhqIEKsuhPRifED9itiXvr57B3K2ZhEJn9r7TTUofAQ0UPbTuEpJb6OThbTxPMcX5Af5pwMQ8T1SBRR45anKE%2BKKXptR3uj7yV6Qc8bBo9KF4PBD05xNQdOqU85ktZGVTx1V%2BIukZ9OaAAPQHdCYntrGEIDMwh9chfhhVGqtMDZ2BAJiI4N4w5LsBP0vR6rTSly%2F3cNDe2ghw0BuKHrSBFb\r\n\r\nApple Developer Center Cupertino and onli