9-09 16:41:49 UTC.\r\n\r\nSSH (Secure Shell) (6 total)\r\nDate	Source IP	Target IP\r\n2026-09-09 16:41:49	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 16:32:28	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 16:25:52	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 16:14:14	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 11:20:08	203.2.151.27	103.246.250.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 11:13:08	203.2.151.27	103.246.250.0/24\r\n\r\nSila siasat punca percubaan log masuk berniat jahat dan ambil tindakan untuk menghentikan serangan itu secepat mungkin.\r\n\r\nMaklumat lanjut tentang isu yang dikesan disediakan di https://incident.netcraft.com/reports/w2vbcprf3ami23t2n75si7\r\nLihat https://incident.netcraft.com/about untuk butiran lanjut termasuk sokongan API.\r\n\r\nYang benar,\r\n\r\nNetcraft\r\n\r\ntelefon: +44(0)1225 447500\r\nFaks: +44(0)1225 448600\r\nNombor Isu Netcraft: 94077035\r\n\r\nUntuk menghubungi kami mengenai update serangan ini, sila menjawab emel ini. Jawapan kepada alamat emel ini akan sentiasa dicatat, tetapi tidak dibaca pada setiap masa. Jika anda percaya bahawa emel ini disalah-kirim, atau anda memerlukan sokongan lanjutan, sila hubungi: support@netcraft.com.\r\n\r\nEmel ini boleh dihurai dengan alatan x-arf. Sila layar http://www.xarf.org/ untuk maklumar lanjut mengenai x-arf.\r\n-------------------\r\nDear Sir or Madam,\r\n\r\nAn IP address within your delegated space is currently involved in an ongoing brute force attack against the following services:\r\n\r\n * SSH (Secure Shell)\r\n\r\nWe have observed more than 6 login attempts within a 6 hour period originating from the following IP address:\r\n\r\n203.2.151.27\r\n\r\nWe last observed a malicious login attempt from this IP address at 2026-09-09 16:41:49 UTC.\r\n\r\nSSH (Secure Shell) (6 total)\r\nDate	Source IP	Target IP\r\n2026-09-09 16:41:49	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 16:32:28	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 16:25:52	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.0/24\r\n2026-09-09 16:14:14	203.2.151.27	139.99.203.