rtdhPu7\r\n\r\nFive presenters seated at a curved desk in a studio, with large screens behind them showing the Mail app on foldable iPhone displays at different sizes.\r\n\r\nROUND 2\r\n\r\nSign up for new iPhone Duo Group Labs\r\n\r\nJoin Apple engineers and designers for new iPhone Duo Group Labs, where you can ask questions, get answers, and follow the discussion about all things Duo.\r\n\r\nRegister for October 13, 6–7 p.m. (PT)\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92hpfAELe2%2BI7lS5heMcf0c2lCYoW4wU3R%2B%2BFyYLXk45um%2FDOg0V8DA8kNIw2V0fL3Ob8IjSkXhOoWdtFXQO05Q1KOchNLDUnNsVphWJcsX7uibH2mJEenfJZzxl5z7GJClyWWrC%2FEj%2Bno%2F9HFVILcqq%2Bl6ehPITjXpp89p5U6GffGnKy27XzhekiOZHqoIlUZLHzP%2FCH8lM4U9zbNH7pwCBFaVrcDLj%2FLt5YuebVrDLJtF9sjkNgcmTHzyuVyCIkefbnzLwvAJeTsjHhO0mS47S\r\n\r\nRegister for October 15, 9-10 a.m. (PT)\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92hpfAELe2%2BI7lS5heMcf0c2lCYoW4wU3R%2B%2BFyYLXk45um%2FDOg0V8DA8kNIw2V0fL3Ob8IjSkXhOoWdtFXQO05Q1KOchNLDUnNsVphWJcsX7uibH2mJEenfJZzxl5z7GJClyWWrC%2FEj%2Bno%2F9HFVILcqq%2Bl6ehPITjXpp89p5U6GffGnKy27XzhekiOZHqoIlUZLHzP%2FCH8lM4U9zbNH7pwCBFaVrcDLj%2FLt5YuebVrDLJm7VPoRpOQUHsQUIQkeFYI%2BDzZMVlTz%2BrAvzwOGzhrBQ\r\n\r\nGet the highlights from the first round of Group Labs — or sit back and watch them in their entirety.\r\n\r\nWatch Group Labs on demand\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92hpfAELe2%2BI7lS5heMcf0c2lCYoW4wU3R%2B%2BFyYLXk45um%2FDOg0V8DA8kNIw2V0fL3Ob8IjSkXhOoWdtFXQO05Q1KOchNLDUnNsVphWJcsX7uibH2mJEenfJZzxl5z7GJClyWWrC%2FEj%2Bno%2F9HFVILcqq%2Bl6ehPITjXpp89p5U6GffGnKy27XzhekiOZHqoIlUZLHzP%2FCH8lM4U9zbNH7pwCBFaVrcDLj%2FLt5YuebVrDLJsgYnDMKuKS6tMdhpyY0bJYFnXCGfwQe8IO1r1hMcILU\r\n\r\nRead about the highlights\r\nhttps:/