e for The Coast app, and search results for \"hiking\" featuring the Forest Explorer app.\r\n\r\nGET CREATIVE\r\n\r\nMake your apps pop on the App Store\r\n\r\nExplore new App Store creative assets that give you fresh ways to showcase your brand and promote seasonal content.\r\n\r\nLearn more\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92hpfAELe2%2BI7lS5heMcf0c2lCYoW4wU3R%2B%2BFyYLXk45um%2FDOg0V8DA8kNIw2V0fL3Ob8IjSkXhOoWdtFXQO05Q1KOchNLDUnNsVphWJcsX7uibH2mJEenfJZzxl5z7GJClyWWrC%2FEj%2Bno%2F9HFVILcqq%2Bl6ehPITjXpp89p5U6GffGnKy27XzhekiOZHqoIlUZLHzP%2FCH8lM4U9zbNH7pwCBFaVrcDLj%2FLt5YuebVrDLJhb69Fw12KS24yNEKeklNg9x83Iu0Mp6hkukQMhFb4zW\r\n\r\nThe Apple Pay for Partners website on a Mac, iPad, and iPhone, showing Merchant Features, resources for Apple Pay integration, and a News and Updates page.\r\n\r\nGROW YOUR BUSINESS\r\n\r\nGet the latest on Apple Pay\r\n\r\nWhether you already offer Apple Pay or are exploring it for the first time, Apple Pay for Partners brings together the latest news, features, and fraud protection information for issuers, merchants, and platforms — all designed to support your integration and help you deliver the payment experience customers know and trust.\r\n\r\nExplore Apple Pay for Partners\r\nhttps://c.apple.com/r?v=2&a=JO1XYJwWmbNCvWbplzNuaBTxOKNHCfrfK8sAr%2BCkMocq%2BkVTiFi%2F9KH9y1JQZhYtV8b75ESNbysU9szDyOQcuQnfbNW0LDMRoHPJMfkM92hpfAELe2%2BI7lS5heMcf0c2lCYoW4wU3R%2B%2BFyYLXk45um%2FDOg0V8DA8kNIw2V0fL3Ob8IjSkXhOoWdtFXQO05Q1KOchNLDUnNsVphWJcsX7uibH2mJEenfJZzxl5z7GJClyWWrC%2FEj%2Bno%2F9HFVILcqq%2Bl6ehPITjXpp89p5U6GffGnKy27XzhekiOZHqoIlUZLHzP%2FCH8lM4U9zbNH7pwCBFaVrcDLj%2FLt5YuebVrDLJiF146r702SlxLBFjI5NIaCXwMgRLwLakczbVqY2MEeZ\r\n\r\nA MacBook Pro running Xcode, with Swift code for an app called Origami in the editor next to a live iPhone preview of project cards. \r\n\r\nUPDATES\r\n\r\nDiscover the new project format in Xcode\r\n\r\nWe’re excited to